## Shopify version of instasearch

Looks like this is a bug in instasearch **v1**, but not in **v2** as this works:
https://codesandbox.io/s/1rvmqq5jm4

But it does not work on my version.

v2  {{ '//cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/instantsearch.js@2/dist/instantsearch.min.js' | script\_tag }}
v1  {{ '//cdn.jsdelivr.net/instantsearch.js/1/instantsearch.min.js' | script\_tag }}

## Docs issue v1/v2

Docs for facetsExcludes say " Each facet must be properly defined in the facets attribute."
See https://community.algolia.com/algoliasearch-helper-js/reference.html#SearchParameters#facetsExcludes

but this works without  the facets attribute in v2 of instasearch :  https://codesandbox.io/s/1rvmqq5jm4

```
  searchParameters: {
    facetsExcludes: {
      brand: ["Sony"]
    },
    hitsPerPage: 8
  }

```
